      "title": "量子コンピュータの4社を、方式と数字で比べる",
      "title_en": "Four quantum computing companies, compared by approach and by the numbers",
      "title_zh": "用方式和数字比较4家量子计算公司",
      "lead": "IonQ・Quantinuum・Rigetti・D-Wave。同じ「量子」でも、作り方も稼ぎ方も違う。 誤りの少なさ、売上、手元の資金を並べると、4社の現在地が見えてくる。 僕は量子株を持ち、IonQは売って指値で待っている。その判断の材料を、ここに置いておく。",
      "lead_en": "IonQ, Quantinuum, Rigetti and D-Wave. All four say \"quantum,\" yet they build and earn in different ways. Lining up error rates, revenue and cash shows where each company stands today. I hold quantum stocks, and I sold IonQ and am waiting with a limit order. This is the material behind that decision.",
